        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository a6aa8b8f-24d3-44b7-ba89-063c251d4881).Image",
        "Description": "Interesting news, 47.\r\rIt seems that the sweet old Helen West in Whittleton Creek is hiding a dark secret. She appears to be a serial killer, and we&apos;ve been hired to stop her. Additionally, we&apos;ve been tasked with eliminating her guards, Jae Serio and Joseph Rickman, along with local politian Charles Blake III, who has agreed to turn a blind eye to her actions once elected in return for an endorsement from the main target. Do what you need to, just make sure there isn&apos;t any collateral.",
